<title>CANADA: Empire to redeem series 3, 4 pfd shares.</title>
<headline>Empire to redeem series 3, 4 pfd shares.</headline>
<dateline>STELLARTON, Nova Scotia 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empire Co Ltd said on Tuesday it plans to redeem 272,952 series 3 preferrred shares at a price of C$25 each plus accrued and unpaid dividends and 1.6 million series 4 preferred shares at C$25.80 each plus accrued and unpaid dividends, both on September 27.</p>
<p>The total redemption price will be C$43,103,800, plus dividends.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
